   "options": "Create\nAlter"
  },
  {
   "default": "0",
   "description": "Off until proven against your Tally. A GUID lets TallyPrime's overwrite-on-same-GUID option recognise a re-import, but ours is not in Tally's own format and a live Tally crashed while importing vouchers carrying it.",
   "fieldname": "send_voucher_guid",
   "fieldtype": "Check",
   "label": "Send a GUID on each voucher"
  },
  {
   "default": "1",
   "description": "On, an invoice carries its items, quantities and rates. Off, each item's value is folded onto the ledger it already posted to and the items are dropped: the accounting is identical and Tally's stock summary stays empty.",
