   "fieldtype": "Check",
   "label": "Send item detail on vouchers"
  },
  {
   "default": "0",
   "description": "Off until proven against your Tally. On, each push carries a small TDL report that asks Tally to say what became of every master and voucher, so a refused record is named with Tally's own words. If Tally answers without it, the push falls back to the totals it reads today.",
